### List tasks
GET {{host}}/tasks/
Authorization: User {{user}}

### List tasks filtered and sorted
GET {{host}}/tasks/?q=assesment&status=todo&sort=created_date
Authorization: User {{user}}

### Create a task
POST {{host}}/tasks/
Authorization: User {{user}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Do assesment",
  "status": "todo"
}

### Get a task
GET {{host}}/tasks/{{task_id}}/
Authorization: User {{user}}

### Update a task
PUT {{host}}/tasks/{{task_id}}/
Authorization: User {{user}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Do assesment",
  "status": "done"
}

### Missing Authorization header (expect 401)
GET {{host}}/tasks/
